{"id":"sukunajogo1","lines":[{"t":0.714,"end":7.981,"chars":[0],"who":"Sukuna","text":"As a token of appreciation for the fingers, if u manage to land even single blow on me I'll work under you for now.","de":"Als Dank für die Finger: Wenn du mir auch nur einen einzigen Treffer landest, arbeite ich vorerst unter dir.","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":7.981,"end":15.129,"chars":[0],"who":"Sukuna","text":"And to begin... How about I slaughter every human in Shibuya... With the exception of one.","de":"Und zum Start… wie wär’s, wenn ich jeden Menschen in Shibuya abschlachte… bis auf einen.","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":15.129,"end":16.253,"chars":[0],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Is that all you've got?","de":"Ist das alles, was du drauf hast?","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":16.253,"end":17.572,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"NOT YET!","de":"NOCH NICHT!","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":17.572,"end":24.234,"chars":[0],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Cursed... Spirit!","de":"Fluch… geist!","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":24.234,"end":39.173,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"Fearful grunt","de":"*ängstliches Knurren*","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":39.173,"end":41.251,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"Punching Grunt","de":"*Schlag-Knurren*","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":41.251,"end":47.233,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"Painful grunting","de":"*schmerzhaftes Stöhnen*","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":47.233,"end":50.247,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"Grunting","de":"*Knurren*","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":50.247,"end":53.005,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"Painful Sound","de":"*Schmerzenslaut*","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":53.005,"end":54.954,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"Landing Grunts","de":"*Landungs-Grunz*","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":54.954,"end":57.031,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"Painful hit","de":"*schmerzhafter Treffer*","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":57.031,"end":61.892,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"Geto how strong would you say I am in terms of Sukuna's Fingers?","de":"Geto, wie stark würdest du mich in Sukunas Fingern einschätzen?","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":61.892,"end":71.047,"chars":[2],"who":"Geto","text":"A generous estimation would be about eight to nine fingers.","de":"Großzügig geschätzt so acht bis neun Finger.","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":71.047,"end":73.21,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"Angry Grunt","de":"*wütendes Knurren*","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":73.21,"end":84.4,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"I Knew.. I knew he was stronger...","de":"Ich wusste… ich wusste, dass er stärker ist…","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":84.4,"end":105.945,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"Hrrah!","de":"Hrrah!","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":105.945,"end":111.891,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"Angry Yells","de":"*wütendes Schreien*","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":111.891,"end":114.487,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"Shocked Gasp","de":"*schockiertes Keuchen*","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/19.mp3"},{"t":114.487,"end":123.311,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"Confused Sound","de":"*verwirrter Laut*","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/20.mp3"},{"t":123.311,"end":127.351,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"I knew there was a difference in our strengths.. But not to such a great extent!","de":"Ich wusste, dass da ein Unterschied ist… aber nicht SO ein krasser!","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/21.mp3"},{"t":127.351,"end":128.623,"chars":[0],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Malicious grinning sound","de":"*böses Grinsen*","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/22.mp3"},{"t":128.623,"end":131.82,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"Grunt","de":"*Knurren*","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/23.mp3"},{"t":131.82,"end":134.058,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"Painful Groaning","de":"*schmerzhaftes Stöhnen*","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/24.mp3"},{"t":134.058,"end":138.455,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"Continued Painful Grunting","de":"*weiteres schmerzhaftes Knurren*","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/25.mp3"},{"t":138.455,"end":141.428,"chars":[1],"who":"Jogo","text":"Vomiting Blood Sound","de":"*Blut erbrechen*","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/26.mp3"},{"t":141.428,"end":150.039,"chars":[0],"who":"Sukuna","text":"The moonlights illumination makes it easier.. To see how pathetic you are...","de":"Im Mondlicht sieht man noch besser… wie erbärmlich du bist…","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/27.mp3"},{"t":150.039,"end":160.139,"chars":[0],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Cmon now.. You musn't stop trying.. I'll play with you again and again until i'm tired of this.","de":"Komm schon… hör nicht auf zu versuchen… ich spiel so lange mit dir, bis mir langweilig wird.","orig":"scenes/sukunajogo1/lines/28.mp3"}]}